      "about-us-2-content": {
        "type": "about-us-2-content",
        "settings": {
          "display_top_content": true,
          "top_heading": "About All Quality",
          "top_subheading": "<div style=\"text-align: left;\">With over 20 years of experience in the rubber stamps, custom office sign and signage industry, All Quality Awards is committed to continuous, reliable, prompt, and accurate service. Our high quality products are always in step with the industry standards so our customers always have access to the latest and greatest products. We specialize in a variety of display products to ensure that your name or brand is prominent, professional, or fun. From rubber stamps to signs to engravable gifts, our products really are unbeatable.\n<br>\nOur staff at All Quality Awards are extremely knowledgeable and professional. We guarantee to provide you, our customer, with the personal attention you deserve. Our service is prompt and professional.\n<br>\nAll Quality Awards recieves orders of all sizes. We have many small orders of one or two nameplates, wall signs, desk signs, or custom rubber stamps as well as large orders for hundreds or even thousands of all kinds of office products.\n<br>\nCustom designs are commonly sent to us to use in the desired nameplate, rubber stamp, name badge, or gift. For a custom design we ask that you send us your design through email, fax, or mail. Our designers will contact you shortly after receipt of the design to discuss the design. Once approval is reached, production will commence. Please see our shipping page for more infomation.\n<br>\nYou can order rubber stamps and office signs online by using our secure server which utilizes SSL technology for your protection. All orders are custom manufactured and usually ship the following business day. You will be able to use our shopping cart system that allows you to select various items from different pages of our site. When you have finished shopping, you can check out and complete your sales transaction via our secure server.\n<br>\nIf you would like to contact us we can be reached Monday through Thursday 9am to 5pm Toll Free at (800) 929-8774.<br> You may also send us an email at sales@allquality.com.\n<br>\nVisit our related companies:\nGavelsFast – For the largest selection of gavels at the lowest prices.<br>\nHH Industries – For high quality glass and acrylic awards.<br>\nPacific Sign and Stamp – For rubber stamps, indoor office signs and name tags.</div>",
          "border_color": "#ffffff",
          "top_content_bgc": "#fafafa",
          "top_content_tt_size": "30",
          "top_content_ttc": "#232323",
          "top_content_txtc": "#3c3c3c",
          "dots_color": "#9c9c9c",
          "display_bottom_content": false,
          "bot_heading": "Behind the scene",
          "bot_subheading": "Phasellus lorem malesuada ligula pulvinar commodo maecenas suscipit auctom."
